===Etymology===
{{L.}} ''[[tonsill]]'', compare French ''[[tonsille]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|anatomy|immunology}} Either of a pair of small masses of [[lymphoid]] tissue that lie on each side of the throat and that help protect the body against infection.

